[{"client_msg_id":"2117552f-35ae-4ce3-b259-af3d1cb5d744","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ただ複数の空白を入れるな \u0026amp; 左右の空白量は同じにしろ、はmustレベルの言及になってる。","ts":"1629548734.060100","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1629548747.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O0Vhs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6305f880-d28c-4ecd-a25e-60edde31bd15","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"\u0026gt; Use your own judgment\nなるほど","ts":"1629548683.059200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UHs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a978884c-4bff-4f17-b022-66e61de9afc6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁ Recommendation だし「低いプライオリティの方にスペースを足す」ことをオプション的に進めてるので、高い方を消せ(must or should)ではないんですよね。","ts":"1629548680.059100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7ed"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9dc7e31-396b-4749-9963-a077b38f49ad","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u003chttps://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0008/#other-recommendations\u003e\n\n\u0026gt; If operators with different priorities are used, consider adding whitespace around the operators with the lowest priority(ies). Use your own judgment; however, never use more than one space, and always have the same amount of whitespace on both sides of a binary operator:","ts":"1629548611.057800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Python.org: PEP 8 -- Style Guide for Python Code","id":1,"title":"PEP 8 -- Style Guide for Python Code","title_link":"https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0008/#other-recommendations","text":"The official home of the Python Programming Language","thumb_url":"https://www.python.org/static/opengraph-icon-200x200.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Python.org","service_icon":"https://www.python.org/static/apple-touch-icon-precomposed.png","thumb_width":200,"thumb_height":200,"from_url":"https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0008/#other-recommendations","original_url":"https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0008/#other-recommendations"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K15"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2e99f58-7d17-4f4f-9f63-aaf4d0b6536d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"なんとなくちょろっと調べてみたら、E226とE302は黙らせているところ多いみたい。","ts":"1629548501.057500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zVC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b337f6c4-9b01-4ff1-ac19-2021c4bad920","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"linterは重要なものに、それ以外はフォーマッタ必須としてそっちで対応、みたいなのがいいんだろうな...","ts":"1629548117.057000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ezp0O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94244467-543b-4a8b-bf95-d113ffeaf07a","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"「flake8を併用するならいくつかの指摘を黙らせろ」と言うのはどのフォーマッターにもあったはず。","ts":"1629547959.056300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ibaww"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2de2716-20e9-4750-96c2-d52124d45b8f","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"そういう小姑みたいな指摘は黙らせてる。","ts":"1629547841.055100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aVs8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89696be2-7ffb-4e19-b1fa-388dd718eaea","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"というか Flake8 が怒ってきた。\n```E226 missing whitespace around arithmetic operator```\nなるほどなぁ。","ts":"1629547770.054700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4jfm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"684b50d1-f410-4180-b25f-87d8bfdbaad2","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"black も yapf も autopep8 も\n`hypot2 = x * x + y * y` に変わるなぁ。どれも pep8 に準拠してないことになるのか","ts":"1629547550.052800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":3,"users":["U022XK5866Q","UAZ33BKV2","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6xp6g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73cab84c-a679-4ad1-9e68-4d17f249c707","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Goだと、演算子の優先順位(の違い)がぱっとわからない時に、空白消されますね。","ts":"1629547521.052000","thread_ts":"1629547521.052000","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1629547534.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kKiI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f891f804-f40f-4e0c-b603-6bc8c72cbe4e","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"リンターに指摘だけさせて、手直しで覚えていくスタイルでしたが、もうフォーマッタでいいかな感……。","ts":"1629547495.051300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Egt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eed6a757-c482-4eee-b0a1-a4aee420e097","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ここらへんは考えずに脳死でフォーマッタに任せるのがいいんだろうな","ts":"1629547379.050100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jKsB3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6cbb0d1-c7c6-42fa-bde5-bbd756ac4bb6","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"優先順位が高い方の演算子の両側にスペースを入れるのは良くない、ということ？いやー、別に良いと思うんだけどな…","ts":"1629546887.049700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"nandato","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TyxDX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da507afd-40c3-4ed4-9cff-aa155f0f7bda","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"\u0026gt; 優先順位が違う演算子を扱う場合、優先順位が一番低い演算子の両側にスペースを入れることを考えてみましょう。","ts":"1629546854.049200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NfDQW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e036a4c7-fc5d-454d-9671-8dffdc39402b","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"\u003chttps://pep8-ja.readthedocs.io/ja/latest/#id18\u003e\nあれ？これ私初耳だな…\n```# 間違い:\ni=i+1\nsubmitted +=1\nx = x * 2 - 1\nhypot2 = x * x + y * y\nc = (a + b) * (a - b)```","ts":"1629546806.048700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8lQr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4201eebe-3b69-453d-8ccb-28774d183c4d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"特にバッチ処理とかで使うとなると、そういうものの優先度が低くなるのでコードが見るも無残なものになりやすい。","ts":"1629546675.048200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r1+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31057acc-1e3d-4ef7-99f6-8c64e84f3467","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"やっぱ統一されたコーディング規約がないと複数人で作業する時に支障が出るんですよね。","ts":"1629546493.047100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V9Gw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3777da56-f713-4999-8e94-03b0256a003d","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"識別子が途切れてしまうとかでない限り、トークンの間の空白文字を許容するほうに一貫している構文のほうが直感的で好きかなーという気がしますね。\n「どこが空白文字許容でどこが許容でないのか」とか覚えるのわりと面倒。\nもちろん好き勝手やられては視認性も悪くなるので、推奨スタイルとかフォーマッタとかはあったほうが良いと思います","ts":"1629546474.047000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mOEmo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9fd1245-6a90-4b4a-bba0-17058abdbfe1","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"そうやって好き勝手コーディングをしてた結果、現場が火の車になったのが自分が勤めている会社です。","ts":"1629546204.042400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hge"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1092a01d-6c63-4190-8c00-64aea29997a9","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"docstring はシュッとツールで入れたいけどフォーマッターはシュッとツールでかけたいって感じな人(人達)ではないってことなんですね。なんとなく不思議。","ts":"1629546045.041300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":f