l":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6GM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3545d1f4-f1e7-4682-8d77-7b9af374b288","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"そういえばそうでした。Blackで強制的に直させるので意識してませんでした。","ts":"1629545288.031100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cWXI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b0f2f98-26a8-4c87-bda8-b782fe53bdba","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"`def foo () :` エラーにならないんですね。なるほど。なんかのフォーマッターなのでしょうかね。","ts":"1629545277.030600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Vm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36ff097c-041a-494b-aa6b-f21f69d609ea","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あ、そうだった、即値だから勘違いしたw","ts":"1629545232.029400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RzYC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e7e162f-8b61-446c-a445-339e6699eafc","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"PEP8ですね。\n\u003chttps://pep8-ja.readthedocs.io/ja/latest/\u003e\n\nアノテーション関係の記述はなかったかもと思いましたが、ありました\n\u0026gt; _アノテーションされていない_ 関数の引数におけるキーワード引数や、デフォルトパラメータを示す `=` の両側にスペースを入れてはいけません","ts":"1629545199.029000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SBb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14003bbf-99e2-4337-8671-093780c486f3","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"それPEPで指摘されましたっけ…？","ts":"1629545103.028300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uq8I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"991ff4e0-54d4-4c34-ae52-3e861b314376","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"最後は関数利用時の引数指定ですね。全部スペース入れたらええやんと思ってます。","ts":"1629545056.027900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Uen"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c96aa11-746f-4b1e-b8ae-e6b868666bcd","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、フォーマッタあるし、視認性の問題はあるからなあ...、というか最後なんでしたっけ、それ","ts":"1629545025.027000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v7f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"597fd759-71b7-428d-a678-ac9b875e39b7","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"一方python\n```foo = 1 # スペース空ける\ndef f(foo=1): # スペース空けない\ndef f(foo: int = 1): # スペース空ける\nf(foo=1) # スペース空けない```\nではあああ？？？ってなります。","ts":"1629544831.026400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O4Mr6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b019b0a-42bc-49fe-8167-606b82170d8b","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"もしかしてPHPかもしれない。~やはりPHPは滅ぼすべき。~","ts":"1629544038.024600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hOeSM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0c3d780-5e78-4321-a8e3-313e0ee9c45c","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"Javaの文化じゃないですかね？~やはりJavaは滅ぼすべき。~","ts":"1629543766.024400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tanJe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73ad3e86-7910-4513-a131-8841043c7e21","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"Python で\n`def foo () :` みたいにスペースあけるのってどこの文化なんだろう。\nオメーのライブラリーバグってんぞって報告きてコード見てみたら、↑みたいなスペース空いてたのでバグった。\n直すけど、ちょっとびっくりしたw","ts":"1629543666.023700","edited":{"user":"U78A6ESHM","ts":"1629543686.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LRdrM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"512023ef-5b28-4b88-990c-1495bb405bb7","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"他の式に組み込まれたときに特にそうなる","ts":"1629547584.053300","thread_ts":"1629547521.052000","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U78A6ESHM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RQbG"}]}]
